WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.041 --> 00:00:32.666
In this verse, Lord Krishna says...

2
00:00:32.666 --> 00:00:36.208
The Supreme Soul sees all beings equally...

3
00:00:36.208 --> 00:00:38.041
When a person becomes familiar with this

4
00:00:38.041 --> 00:00:40.708
impartial nature of the Divine...

5
00:00:40.708 --> 00:00:44.083
their vision becomes free from 
material coverings and distinctions,

6
00:00:44.083 --> 00:00:48.291
seeing all beings equally...

7
00:00:48.291 --> 00:00:50.500
This realization gives birth to compassion,

8
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.583
love, equanimity,

9
00:00:52.583 --> 00:00:56.458
and respect for all beings in one's heart...

10
00:00:56.458 --> 00:00:59.458
They see the Divine in every being...

11
00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:00.041
This knowledge

12
00:01:00.041 --> 00:01:04.208
takes human life to a new height...

13
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.500
What transformation occurs

14
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.041
in a person's perspective

15
00:01:12.041 --> 00:01:13.750
after gaining knowledge?

16
00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:15.458
Lord Krishna mentions this

17
00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:17.083
in this verse.

18
00:01:17.083 --> 00:01:18.041
How will discrimination

19
00:01:18.041 --> 00:01:19.500
be eliminated

20
00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:23.000
and unity and love be 
established in the world...??

21
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.208
Clarifying the answer to this question,

22
00:01:25.208 --> 00:01:28.041
Lord Krishna says in this verse...,

23
00:01:28.041 --> 00:01:28.875
When a person

24
00:01:28.875 --> 00:01:31.250
attains supreme knowledge,

25
00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:32.833
they gain an equal vision

26
00:01:32.833 --> 00:01:35.750
toward every being...

27
00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:38.250
Free from material distinctions,

28
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:39.125
they see each being

29
00:01:39.125 --> 00:01:40.541
as a part of

30
00:01:40.541 --> 00:01:42.250
the Supreme Soul...

31
00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:44.458
One who has attained supreme knowledge

32
00:01:44.458 --> 00:01:45.583
abandons

33
00:01:45.583 --> 00:01:48.416
traditional, social, and material distinctions

34
00:01:48.416 --> 00:01:52.500
to view all beings equally...

35
00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.250
For them, neither is a Brahmin a 
symbol of the mode of goodness,

36
00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:57.333
nor is an untouchable

37
00:01:57.333 --> 00:01:59.041
a symbol of the mode of ignorance...

38
00:01:59.041 --> 00:02:01.875
In their eyes, a cow, an elephant,

39
00:02:01.875 --> 00:02:02.708
and a dog

40
00:02:02.708 --> 00:02:06.750
are all equal...

41
00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:09.083
The wise person knows that

42
00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:12.083
the Divine exists in every being...

43
00:02:12.083 --> 00:02:15.500
and all deserve full honor and respect...

44
00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:16.333
This message of the Bhagavad Gita

45
00:02:16.333 --> 00:02:17.958
not only has the power

46
00:02:17.958 --> 00:02:20.625
to transform human life...

47
00:02:20.625 --> 00:02:22.041
but also paves the way for unity

48
00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:25.041
and love in society...

49
00:02:25.041 --> 00:02:28.208
This knowledge removes the darkness of ego,

50
00:02:28.208 --> 00:02:31.583
hatred, and discrimination 
from the human mind...

51
00:02:31.583 --> 00:02:38.000
In present times, due to distinctions of 
religion, caste, class, etc,

52
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:41.875
this world has forgotten 
the path of love and equality.. 

53
00:02:41.875 --> 00:02:44.750
This teaching of the Bhagavad Gita not only

54
00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:47.750
gives the world instructions on peace and unity

55
00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.875
but also inspires to live a pure, compassionate,

56
00:02:49.875 --> 00:02:54.333
and a spiritual life...

57
00:02:59.125 --> 00:03:00.208
Are you aware

58
00:03:00.208 --> 00:03:03.208
of this truth...

59
00:03:03.208 --> 00:03:05.458
A wise person's wisdom

60
00:03:05.458 --> 00:03:08.791
isn't determined by

61
00:03:08.791 --> 00:03:11.250
how much they've studied

62
00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:15.291
or how many degrees they've earned...

63
00:03:15.291 --> 00:03:20.125
but by how humble they remain

64
00:03:20.125 --> 00:03:27.125
toward others even after gaining knowledge...

65
00:03:27.125 --> 00:03:31.416
Perhaps you've experienced

66
00:03:31.416 --> 00:03:32.375
that when

67
00:03:32.375 --> 00:03:36.708
someone gains more knowledge

68
00:03:36.708 --> 00:03:40.291
or becomes more successful in life,

69
00:03:40.291 --> 00:03:42.666
a sense of superiority and ego

70
00:03:42.666 --> 00:03:45.833
Knowledge gives you a divine 
vision of love, compassion,

71
00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:47.500
is born in their mind...

72
00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:49.291
But

73
00:03:49.291 --> 00:03:57.458
these aren't the qualities of a truly wise person...

74
00:03:57.458 --> 00:04:01.500
and equality...

75
00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:04.166
You see everyone

76
00:04:04.166 --> 00:04:05.625
with the same eyes...

77
00:04:05.625 --> 00:04:12.875
whether poor or rich, educated or uneducated...

78
00:04:12.875 --> 00:04:16.583
Whatever their material ability, social status,

79
00:04:16.583 --> 00:04:20.125
or appearance may be...

80
00:04:20.125 --> 00:04:22.333
for you, all are

81
00:04:22.333 --> 00:04:26.166
simply parts of the Divine...!!!

82
00:04:26.166 --> 00:04:27.666
Therefore,

83
00:04:27.666 --> 00:04:29.833
remember

84
00:04:29.833 --> 00:04:33.083
that true knowledge doesn't make you arrogant...

85
00:04:33.083 --> 00:04:36.708
but humble and compassionate...

86
00:04:36.708 --> 00:04:41.166
Now ask yourself some questions...

87
00:04:41.166 --> 00:04:45.875
Has my knowledge made me humble,

88
00:04:45.875 --> 00:04:48.708
or do I feel

89
00:04:48.708 --> 00:04:52.708
superior to others?

90
00:04:52.708 --> 00:04:57.833
Do I view every being equally,

91
00:04:57.833 --> 00:05:01.458
or do I merely criticize them?

92
00:05:01.458 --> 00:05:03.708
Do I see everyone

93
00:05:03.708 --> 00:05:07.250
as a part of the Divine...?

94
00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:09.291
If your knowledge

95
00:05:09.291 --> 00:05:11.041
isn't leading you toward humility

96
00:05:11.041 --> 00:05:14.375
and compassion...

97
00:05:14.375 --> 00:05:17.791
then you must consider

98
00:05:17.791 --> 00:05:22.750
whether you're on the 
right path of knowledge...??

99
00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:27.041
Because knowledge makes you sensitive

100
00:05:27.041 --> 00:05:31.375
toward every being like the sun...

101
00:05:31.375 --> 00:05:34.708
The day you see

102
00:05:34.708 --> 00:05:38.541
the divine light in every being...

103
00:05:38.541 --> 00:05:40.333
that is the day

104
00:05:40.333 --> 00:05:43.208
you'll become truly wise...

105
00:05:47.291 --> 00:05:49.916
Have you ever wondered

106
00:05:49.916 --> 00:05:55.041
why disagreements occur in families?

107
00:05:55.041 --> 00:05:56.833
The reason is...

108
00:05:56.833 --> 00:05:59.166
different ideologies

109
00:05:59.166 --> 00:06:01.458
among family members...

110
00:06:01.458 --> 00:06:04.375
These different viewpoints become the cause

111
00:06:04.375 --> 00:06:07.416
of disagreements in the family...

112
00:06:07.416 --> 00:06:11.166
So should these differences be 
allowed to cause your family

113
00:06:11.166 --> 00:06:16.166
relationships to break?

114
00:06:16.166 --> 00:06:18.791
No...!!!

115
00:06:18.791 --> 00:06:23.083
See every family member not just in their role

116
00:06:23.083 --> 00:06:23.916
as parent,

117
00:06:23.916 --> 00:06:28.375
sibling, or child...

118
00:06:28.375 --> 00:06:31.541
but as a part of the Divine...

119
00:06:31.541 --> 00:06:36.958
When you begin to view family
 from this spiritual perspective,

120
00:06:36.958 --> 00:06:42.166
relationships become stress-free and pure...

121
00:06:42.166 --> 00:06:49.916
When you view family relationships 
from a spiritual perspective,

122
00:06:49.916 --> 00:06:53.458
jealousy, anger, and hatred

123
00:06:53.458 --> 00:06:55.375
vanish from your mind...

124
00:06:55.375 --> 00:06:59.666
You begin to see relationships with a new perspective...

125
00:06:59.666 --> 00:07:03.416
You accept that each member is

126
00:07:03.416 --> 00:07:07.375
on their own life journey...

127
00:07:07.375 --> 00:07:10.666
Even if disagreements

128
00:07:10.666 --> 00:07:13.291
or conflicts arise...

129
00:07:13.291 --> 00:07:17.875
they can neither change your relationships

130
00:07:17.875 --> 00:07:22.041
nor diminish your love...

131
00:07:22.041 --> 00:07:26.458
Your family is like a garden of flowers...

132
00:07:26.458 --> 00:07:28.125
where there are many types of flowers...

133
00:07:28.125 --> 00:07:33.375
like roses, lotuses, sunflowers, 
and night-blooming jasmines...

134
00:07:33.375 --> 00:07:36.541
Just as every flower differs from others

135
00:07:36.541 --> 00:07:37.500
in color, fragrance,

136
00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:41.375
and shape...

137
00:07:41.375 --> 00:07:45.583
Similarly, every family member
 differs in thoughts,

138
00:07:45.583 --> 00:07:50.458
personality, and desires...

139
00:07:50.458 --> 00:07:52.041
But

140
00:07:52.041 --> 00:07:54.250
beyond these differences

141
00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:56.541
is a common thread

142
00:07:56.541 --> 00:08:00.416
that keeps you connected to each other...

143
00:08:00.416 --> 00:08:02.333
It is

144
00:08:02.333 --> 00:08:07.416
that you are all parts of the same Divine...

145
00:08:07.416 --> 00:08:08.250
This knowledge

146
00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:10.916
awakens a spiritual connection

147
00:08:10.916 --> 00:08:14.541
in your relationships...

148
00:08:14.541 --> 00:08:18.083
and removes disagreements, 
bitterness, differences,

149
00:08:18.083 --> 00:08:21.416
and conflicts from the family...

150
00:08:21.416 --> 00:08:24.208
After gaining this knowledge,

151
00:08:24.208 --> 00:08:27.583
your focus shifts from winning every argument

152
00:08:27.583 --> 00:08:32.291
or imposing your decisions on the family to

153
00:08:32.291 --> 00:08:34.916
maintaining peace, love,

154
00:08:34.916 --> 00:08:37.083
and harmony

155
00:08:37.083 --> 00:08:40.250
at home...

156
00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:45.666
And this is the path to happiness, prosperity,

157
00:08:45.666 --> 00:08:48.666
and peace for your family...

158
00:08:53.666 --> 00:08:56.333
In your workplace,

159
00:08:56.333 --> 00:08:59.208
you work with colleagues who have 
different personalities, perspectives,

160
00:08:59.208 --> 00:09:03.500
and abilities...

161
00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:07.541
Perhaps you've noticed that each

162
00:09:07.541 --> 00:09:11.791
person works in their unique way...

163
00:09:11.791 --> 00:09:13.541
and everyone has

164
00:09:13.541 --> 00:09:16.666
their own specialties...

165
00:09:16.666 --> 00:09:18.833
In such a case, it's natural

166
00:09:18.833 --> 00:09:21.375
that some colleagues' viewpoints

167
00:09:21.375 --> 00:09:26.125
match yours and some don't...

168
00:09:26.125 --> 00:09:27.416
So should

169
00:09:27.416 --> 00:09:28.708
you view them

170
00:09:28.708 --> 00:09:31.708
differently?

171
00:09:31.708 --> 00:09:33.208
No..!

172
00:09:33.208 --> 00:09:34.583
It's natural

173
00:09:34.583 --> 00:09:37.500
to favor those colleagues

174
00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:39.250
who perform well

175
00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:43.041
or align with your thoughts...

176
00:09:43.041 --> 00:09:46.875
But a mark of successful leadership is

177
00:09:46.875 --> 00:09:51.916
to view every colleague equally...

178
00:09:51.916 --> 00:09:54.833
just as a wise person sees

179
00:09:54.833 --> 00:09:58.666
the Divine in every being...

180
00:09:58.666 --> 00:10:05.750
A successful leader doesn't view
 all teammates with the same capacity...

181
00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:08.333
they recognize the hidden

182
00:10:08.333 --> 00:10:11.416
qualities and abilities in each colleague

183
00:10:11.416 --> 00:10:15.416
and give them opportunities to develop...

184
00:10:15.416 --> 00:10:17.500
Imagine,

185
00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:21.333
there's a new member in your organization...

186
00:10:21.333 --> 00:10:22.750
whose working style

187
00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:29.750
and ability seem raw and incomplete 
compared to others...

188
00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:31.125
Will

189
00:10:31.125 --> 00:10:36.916
you consider them insignificant because 
of their undeveloped state...???

190
00:10:36.916 --> 00:10:38.708
No...

191
00:10:38.708 --> 00:10:41.750
Recognize the hidden potential within them

192
00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:46.250
and provide proper guidance...

193
00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:48.791
Like a successful organization head,

194
00:10:48.791 --> 00:10:51.916
view them with the same eyes

195
00:10:51.916 --> 00:10:55.500
as you view other members...

196
00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:59.041
Give them the same opportunities as others

197
00:10:59.041 --> 00:11:01.041
and become a source of their confidence

198
00:11:01.041 --> 00:11:03.833
and motivation...

199
00:11:03.833 --> 00:11:08.375
This is the true form of successful leadership...

200
00:11:08.375 --> 00:11:14.916
Just as a gardener sees the potential
 for growth within a seed,

201
00:11:14.916 --> 00:11:17.333
see the capability and talent

202
00:11:17.333 --> 00:11:20.791
in every person in the organization...

203
00:11:20.791 --> 00:11:22.583
This quality of yours

204
00:11:22.583 --> 00:11:26.791
will take the organization to the
 peak of success...!!!
